that runs the cellular automaton rule on a tape of length tapeLength by \
compiling it to a cyclic tag system, running that system and decoding the \
result. CompiledCellularAutomatonToCyclicTag[rule, tapeLength, tapeStates] \
uses at least tapeStates tape symbols. CompiledCellularAutomatonToCyclicTag \
[...][init, steps] runs the cellular automaton from init for steps steps.", 
